### Create a new reviewer
POST https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/reviewers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

###

### Get all reviewers (after creating at least one)
GET https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/reviewers
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get a single reviewer by ID (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
GET https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/reviewers/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update an existing reviewer (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
PUT https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/reviewers/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

###

### Delete a reviewer (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
DELETE https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/reviewers/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

###
